{"type": "Title", "element_id": "e233ba4a6907983ed2d6302222910bf2", "text": "Generating Map Screen", "metadata": {"languages": ["eng"], "filename": "18453.txt", "filetype": "text/plain", "data_source": {"url": null, "version": null, "record_locator": {"id": "18453", "key": "MAP-554", "board_id": null, "project_id": "MAP"}, "date_created": "2025-03-12T02:35:35.821+0000", "date_modified": "2025-03-27T23:48:20.663+0000", "date_processed": "1744461415.3504908", "permissions_data": null, "filesize_bytes": 1389}}}
{"type": "NarrativeText", "element_id": "dd58ae7e6a35cf7137dc8c0bf890fcef", "text": "When clicking Map from the upload screen, i am taken to a loading screen, I must then click Continue to get to my map.", "metadata": {"languages": ["eng"], "filename": "18453.txt", "filetype": "text/plain", "parent_id": "e233ba4a6907983ed2d6302222910bf2", "data_source": {"url": null, "version": null, "record_locator": {"id": "18453", "key": "MAP-554", "board_id": null, "project_id": "MAP"}, "date_created": "2025-03-12T02:35:35.821+0000", "date_modified": "2025-03-27T23:48:20.663+0000", "date_processed": "1744461415.3504908", "permissions_data": null, "filesize_bytes": 1389}}}
{"type": "NarrativeText", "element_id": "5fd74c093d284f0bfea6b5f56629edb5", "text": "This page exists because we need the criteria structure to load in the background.", "metadata": {"languages": ["eng"], "filename": "18453.txt", "filetype": "text/plain", "parent_id": "e233ba4a6907983ed2d6302222910bf2", "data_source": {"url": null, "version": null, "record_locator": {"id": "18453", "key": "MAP-554", "board_id": null, "project_id": "MAP"}, "date_created": "2025-03-12T02:35:35.821+0000", "date_modified": "2025-03-27T23:48:20.663+0000", "date_processed": "1744461415.3504908", "permissions_data": null, "filesize_bytes": 1389}}}
{"type": "NarrativeText", "element_id": "391d8c4f3975c561ce22406fb7447985", "text": "Changes: Instead of having a user driven interaction (pressing the Continue button) we have a loading screen that changes automatically when the report is ready to be accessed.", "metadata": {"languages": ["eng"], "filename": "18453.txt", "filetype": "text/plain", "parent_id": "e233ba4a6907983ed2d6302222910bf2", "data_source": {"url": null, "version": null, "record_locator": {"id": "18453", "key": "MAP-554", "board_id": null, "project_id": "MAP"}, "date_created": "2025-03-12T02:35:35.821+0000", "date_modified": "2025-03-27T23:48:20.663+0000", "date_processed": "1744461415.3504908", "permissions_data": null, "filesize_bytes": 1389}}}
{"type": "NarrativeText", "element_id": "2630b68a4057aea629d84714f7cddb40", "text": "Note: We also want to remove the back button in the app so users are unable to go back during this process.", "metadata": {"languages": ["eng"], "filename": "18453.txt", "filetype": "text/plain", "parent_id": "e233ba4a6907983ed2d6302222910bf2", "data_source": {"url": null, "version": null, "record_locator": {"id": "18453", "key": "MAP-554", "board_id": null, "project_id": "MAP"}, "date_created": "2025-03-12T02:35:35.821+0000", "date_modified": "2025-03-27T23:48:20.663+0000", "date_processed": "1744461415.3504908", "permissions_data": null, "filesize_bytes": 1389}}}
